{"id":"0d8969c7b834f5a6","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-external-logic.md","title":"外部逻辑","display":"df-external-logic — 外部逻辑","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-external-logic","aliases":["91-df-external-logic"],"display":"df-external-logic — 外部逻辑","depends_on":["[[91-df-internal-logic]]","[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-external-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-external-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-external-logic — 外部逻辑"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9f50803c6dbd04e\" href=\"?note=c9f50803c6dbd04e\" title=\"91-df-internal-logic\">91-df-internal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f276735320c6ad44\" href=\"?note=f276735320c6ad44\" title=\"91-df-fixed-point-model\">91-df-fixed-point-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2a6ae68f45ba9960\" href=\"?note=2a6ae68f45ba9960\" title=\"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction\">91-df-three-valued-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-external-logic-—-外部逻辑-$\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}$\">df-external-logic — 外部逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_X\">\\(\\mathfrak M_X\\)</span> (由固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 诱导的三值模型)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(X)=X\">\\(J(X)=X\\)</span> (固定点真句编码集)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vDash_3\">\\(\\vDash_3\\)</span> (三值满足关系)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}(\\mathfrak M_X)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}(\\mathfrak M_X)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 是下述定义的固定点模型指定值真句集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}\\)</span> 为模型层级的角色下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}(\\mathfrak M_X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}(\\mathfrak M_X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}\\)</span> : 外部逻辑（在模型层面进行的推理）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\">\\(\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\)</span>：固定点模型中的指定值满足关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>：真句编码外延</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：外部逻辑是从理论外部（模型层面）观察真理集的推理方式。其特征如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>经典元推理</strong>：元理论可经典地推理集合成员关系和三值语义事实</li>\n<li><strong>模型视角</strong>：从固定点模型的角度判断句子真值</li>\n<li><strong>不强迫二值性</strong>：元理论知道某句未被判真，不等于模型满足其否定</li>\n</ol>\n<p>与内部逻辑的对比：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>内部逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Int}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Int}}\\)</span></th>\n<th>外部逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}\\)</span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>推理层面</td>\n<td>理论内部（KF公理推理）</td>\n<td>模型层面（满足关系）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真理谓词</td>\n<td>使用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>作为谓词</td>\n<td>使用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\infty}\">\\(X_{\\infty}\\)</span>作为真理集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>说谎者句子</td>\n<td>对其真理断言的对象层推理</td>\n<td>元层可证明其编码不在某固定点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑规则</td>\n<td>由对象理论及真理公理决定</td>\n<td>元理论可经典，但对象满足仍可三值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>关键区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>经典对象逻辑仍证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\\lor\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\\lor\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>但在三值固定点语义中，“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X\">\\(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X\\)</span>”不推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\">\\(\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\\)</span>；后者要求相应的负外延信息。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种区分是理解 KF 的关键：KF 的普通对象推理仍是经典的；呈现部分性的是\n经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 内化的后承关系和强 Kleene 预期语义。避免悖论依靠受控的真理\n公理，而不是删减普通经典推理规则。外部元理论可以分析三值，但这不把\n每个句子强制成二值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-external-logic-—-外部逻辑-$\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}$","text":"df-external-logic — 外部逻辑 $\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-internal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"c9f50803c6dbd04e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-internal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-fixed-point-model","status":"resolved","id":"f276735320c6ad44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T$ (扩展语言, see [[91-df-language-with-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"J(X)=X","display":false},{"tex":"\\vDash_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}(\\mathfrak M_X)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}(\\mathfrak M_X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\varphi\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Int}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Ext}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\infty}","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\\lor\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":3043,"backlinks":[{"id":"f28d9b3f22314622","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-external-logic]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n